e", "words": [93, 94], "s": 970, "e": 982, "emph": false, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "would", "words": [95], "s": 982, "e": 988, "emph": false, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "follow", "words": [96], "s": 988, "e": 997, "emph": false, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "the highest", "words": [97, 98], "s": 997, "e": 1014, "emph": false, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "peaks", "words": [99], "s": 1014, "e": 1022, "emph": true, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "of the Andes.", "words": [100, 101, 102], "s": 1022, "e": 1055, "emph": false, "beat": "b10"}, {"text": "So Chile", "words": [103, 104], "s": 1055, "e": 1074, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "kept", "words": [105], "s": 1074, "e": 1081, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "the narrow", "words": [106, 107], "s": 1081, "e": 1096, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "strip", "words": [108], "s": 1096, "e": 1104, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "between", "words": [109], "s": 1104, "e": 1113, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "the mountains", "words": [110, 111], "s": 1113, "e": 1129, "emph": false, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "and the sea.", "words": [112, 113, 114], "s": 1129, "e": 1151, "emph": true, "beat": "b11"}, {"text": "It's not a", "words": [115, 116, 117], "s": 1151, "e": 1163, "emph": false, "beat": "b12"}, {"text": "strange", "words": [118], "s": 1163, "e": 1175, "emph": false, "beat": "b12"}, {"text": "shape.", "words": [119], "s": 1175, "e": 1193, "emph": false, "beat": "b12"}, {"text": "It's the edge", "words": [120, 121, 122], "s": 1193, "e": 1211, "emph": false, "beat": "b12"}, {"text": "of a continent.", "words": [123, 124, 125], "s": 1211, "e": 1242, "emph": true, "beat": "b12"}]}